# Bootstrap package for the devflow-auth bounded context adapter.
#
# When the devflow-auth module is scaffolded, this package will hold
# the application-level bridge that wires the auth module into the
# Spring Security filter chain.
#
# Core auth logic (User aggregate, JWT, RBAC) will reside in:
#   com.devflow.modules.auth.*
#
# Reference: docs/architecture/DOMAIN_MODEL.md §3.1 (IAM Bounded Context)
